OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to find musicians in time
OL,4,Afor Remembrance parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA veterans' charity has issued a
OL,7,Flast-minute appeal for musicians to
OL,8,Fhelp complete its Remembrance Sunday
OL,9,Fparade.
OL,11,FHalton Royal British Legion said the
OL,12,Fband originally booked to play had been
OL,13,Fstood down because of uncertainty over
OL,14,Fwhether the village's parade would go
OL,15,Fahead.
OL,17,FThe event has now been given the green
OL,18,Flight, but many of the musicians are
OL,19,Fcommitted to commemorations at their
OL,20,Fown local cenotaphs.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
