OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to find musicians in time
OL,4,Afor Remembrance parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity is urgently seeking
OL,7,Fplayers, particularly a drummer, bass
OL,8,Fdrummer, flautist and piper. It said a
OL,9,Ffull marching band "would be the
OL,10,Fdream", but acknowledged finding one at
OL,11,Fsuch short notice might be difficult.
